  "goodToKnow": "Das Feuilleton is the arts and culture section of a German newspaper, covering literature, theatre, film, philosophy and debates; major ones are those of the FAZ, Süddeutsche Zeitung and Die Zeit. Das Feuilleton also stands for the critics as a group: Das Feuilleton ist begeistert. The word comes from French feuille (leaf, sheet). Feuilletonistisch can mean light and witty. Plural: die Feuilletons."
